1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:04,890
(Penny:)Hey, here's another possible
topic of conversation.

2
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:06,710
(Penny:)This is a big night for Sheldon.

3
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:08,780
(Penny:)Right, Sheldon?

4
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:11,580
(Sheldon:)Big night?

5
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:14,120
(Sheldon:)The winter solstice
is a big night.

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,170
(Sheldon:)It's over 14 hours

7
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,620
(Sheldon:)in Southern California.

8
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:20,710
(Amy:)That's an amusing factoid.

9
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:23,090
(Penny(spits out drink explosively. Howard types. Robot arm hands Penny a napkin):)Thank you.

10
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,340
(Howard:)No, no.

11
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:29,950
(Penny:)My point is, uh, tonight is
Sheldon's first official date.

12
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:31,650
(Penny:)Discuss.

13
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:32,880
(Amy:)Is this true?

14
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:36,220
(Sheldon:)Apparently, a semi-incestuous
Teens for Jesus

15
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,560
(Sheldon:)Fourth of July Hoedown
didn't count.

16
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:41,940
(Penny:)So, um, Amy, what about you?

17
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:42,910
(Penny:)Do you date much?

18
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,230
(Amy:)Once a year.

19
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:46,360
(Amy:)It's a deal I made
with my mother in exchange for

20
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,550
(Amy:)her silence on the matter,
as well as the occasional use

21
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:49,730
(Amy:)of her George Foreman Grill

22
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:53,260
that seals in the flavor
without the fat.

23
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,710
(Amy:)How about you, Penny?

24
00:00:55,710 --> 00:00:56,930
(Amy:)Do you go on many dates?

25
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,840
(Penny:)Uh, yeah, I wouldn't say many.

26
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:03,020
(Scene:)A few.

